"engine summary; the first preset is the usual distribution setup. Other "
"overrides stay unchanged. Apply saves edits. Commands support placeholders "
"{engine}, {id} (short container id), {name}, {image}, {shell}, {tail}, "
"{project} and {file}; names and image references are quoted. Subshells such "
"as $(...) work. Podman is experimental."
